meta {
  name: Invitations - List
  type: http
  seq: 66
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/invitations?limit=10&offset=0
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  limit: 10
  offset: 0
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The pending invitations of the community, newest first (#1242): email, role, created_at, expires_at, is_expired, and the access_groups (cuid, name) and member_tags (the tag) that each gives at the join, by name (#1390). Offset pagination (limit 10 by default, 1000 at most, offset; metadata.pagination). Owner, admins, and moderators with the manage_members right.
}
